# Rancher Deploy

Terraform IaC for Rancher + RKE2 clusters on Proxmox (manager + apps environments).

Cursor uses `.cursor/rules/` (this file + org common). Copilot instructions under `.github/` remain for other tools.

## Key paths

- `terraform/environments/manager/` and `terraform/environments/nprd-apps/` — separate applies/state
- Module scripts under `terraform/modules/`

## Conventions

- Always `cd` into the environment dir before `terraform apply`; never apply from repo root
- Copy `.tfvars.example` → `.tfvars` before init; never commit secrets or live tokens
- Prefer pinned RKE2 / provider versions already used in-tree over floating `latest`
